    "title": "Endovascular thrombectomy for large-core ischemic stroke",
    "research_question": "In adults with acute large-core ischemic stroke, compare endovascular thrombectomy plus medical care with medical care alone for the efficacy and safety outcomes defined in the Review methods.",
    "review_criteria": "Randomized trials of internal carotid artery or middle cerebral artery M1 occlusion with ASPECTS 5 or lower or ischemic-core volume at least 50 mL, comparing endovascular thrombectomy plus medical care with medical care alone and reporting an efficacy or safety outcome defined below.",
